# Migration Scripts Guide

## Core Migration Scripts

### Simple Migration
- [migrate_mongodump.py](mdc:mongo-migration/solutions/simple-migration/scripts/migrate_mongodump.py): Handles MongoDB data export using `mongodump`
- [migrate_all_collections.py](mdc:mongo-migration/solutions/simple-migration/scripts/migrate_all_collections.py): Manages multi-collection migration

### Complex Migration
- [migrate_all_collections.py](mdc:mongo-migration/solutions/complex-migration/scripts/migrate_all_collections.py): Handles complex feature migration
- [transform-rules.json](mdc:mongo-migration/solutions/complex-migration/config/transform-rules.json): Defines schema transformations

### Python Migration Utilities
Located in [mongodb2ora_migrationtools](mdc:mongo-migration/mongodb2ora_migrationtools):
- [mongo2ora_singlecollection.py](mdc:mongo-migration/mongodb2ora_migrationtools/mongo2ora_singlecollection.py): Single collection migration
- [mongo2ora_data.py](mdc:mongo-migration/mongodb2ora_migrationtools/mongo2ora_data.py): Core data migration logic

## Configuration Files
- [config.ini](mdc:mongo-migration/mongodb2ora_migrationtools/config/config.ini): Main configuration file
- [atlas_dbcs.config.ini](mdc:mongo-migration/mongodb2ora_migrationtools/config/atlas_dbcs.config.ini): Atlas-specific configuration
- [atpconfig.ini](mdc:mongo-migration/mongodb2ora_migrationtools/config/atpconfig.ini): ATP-specific configuration

## Script Dependencies
- All scripts require Python 3.9+
- Required packages: cx_Oracle, PyMongo
- Oracle Database 19c+ for target
- MongoDB 4.4+ for source
